# data/processed/

This folder contains all generated datasets produced by `scripts/01_generate_data.py` and `scripts/02_statistical_analysis.py`.

## Files generated on first run

| File | Rows | Generated by |
|---|---|---|
| `experiment_data.csv` | 48,312 | `01_generate_data.py` |
| `daily_summary.csv` | 28 | `01_generate_data.py` |
| `group_summary.csv` | 2 | `01_generate_data.py` |
| `daily_summary.json` | 28 | `01_generate_data.py` |
| `group_summary.json` | 2 | `01_generate_data.py` |
| `analysis_results.json` | — | `02_statistical_analysis.py` |

## How to generate

```bash
python scripts/01_generate_data.py
python scripts/02_statistical_analysis.py
```
